&lt;p&gt;This event is co-sponsored by the &lt;a href="https://ilas.columbia.edu/brazilian-studies" target="_blank"&gt;Lemann Center for Brazilian Studies&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp; the&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://ilas.columbia.edu/" target="_blank"&gt;Institute of Latin American Studies (ILAS)&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
